NNAAMMEE
       pbmtoescp2 - convert a PBM image to a ESC/P2 printer file


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppbbmmttooeessccpp22

       [--ccoommpprreessss==_c_o_m_p_r_e_s_s_i_o_n_m_o_d_e]                 [--rreessoolluuttiioonn=={118800|336600|772200}]
       [--ssttrriippeehheeiigghhtt==_n] [--ffoorrmmffeeeedd] [--rraaww] [_p_b_m_f_i_l_e]

       All options can be abbreviated to their shortest  unique  prefix.   You
       may use two hyphens instead of one to designate an option.  You may use
